*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE] Automation of Feature 5GC001013 sub-feature R
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope:
...               1/ Setup Gap different misconfigurations in case of SgNBAddtionRequest and check X2ap/F1ap call
...               flow + check Reject Error Cause
...               2/ Setup Gap different misconfigurations in case of SgNBModificationRequest and check X2ap/F1ap
...               call flow + check Reject Error Cause
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation author : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation contact: loic.marzin@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 25-Feb-2020
...               Modified Date               : 28-Jun-2022
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@Nokia.com -- Modification for TCP/MCShark
...               Modified Date               : 08-Mar-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Modify KW Set enDcSyncStatus due to issue with chaining several tests
...                                                                     Modify Test Teardown to restore original gNB SCF at end of each test
...               Modified Date               : 13-Oct-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Remove of Tags
...               Modified Date               : 19-Dec-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Regroup tests into 2 new tests
...               Modified Date               : 29-Jan-2023
...               Modification                : loic.marzin@nokia.com - Refactoring 1013-R020


