*** Keywords ***
TC 1013 Mod CU Reject Hex NoChain
    [Documentation]                 Generic test for 5GC001013_R :
    ...                             1/ Modification of enDcSyncStatus parameter on gNB cOAM WebUI
    ...                             2/ Setup Misconfigured Gap Measurements in case of SgNBModificationRequest procedure
    ...                             3/ Check X2ap/F1ap call flow + MeasGapConfig in case of SgNBModificationRequest/Reject procedure
    ...                             4/ Check Error value in SgNBMoodificationReject
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Variables
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Step                            Test Name Display
    Step                            Set enDcSyncStatus
    Step                            Setup WTS                                   depends=Set enDcSyncStatus
	Step                            Start Core Capture                          depends=Setup WTS
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
	Step                            4G UE Attach                                depends=Start Core Capture
	Step 							5G UE Attach					     		depends=4G UE Attach
	Step                            WTS Send Hex		                        depends=5G UE Attach
    Step                            Stop Capture                                depends=WTS Send Hex
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    Step                            Check CU GAP Setup Flow                     depends=Stop Capture
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    Step                            Check Reject Error Cause                    depends=Check CU GAP Setup Flow
    ...                             argument=${CAPTURE_GNB}
    [Teardown]                      Teardown 1013 Mod CU Reject Hex NoChain

